मण्डलम् स्तरपरीक्षण ॥

॰ W-359 delta review: the same chain ONE level deeper — ९ tail calls, ten
॰ routines. `स्तरख` … `स्तरञ` are grow-and-return (८ deep), the root `स्तरक` is
॰ NOT on either twin, so its tail return of `स्तरख` is refused statically by
॰ both front ends (rule A, kind २) before anything runs.

